        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S44R4HDB,  4\" x 4\" x 1/4\" Radius  Durable Heavy Duty Steel Hinge With 2 Ball Bearings</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2) matching finish steel flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1\" wood screws and #12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy Duty 0.129\" thick construction with 2 Ball Bearings for smooth action.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44R4HDB-specifications.gif?v=1704354733\" width=\"567\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S44R4HDB Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4\" x 1/4\" Radius Corner Hinge with Ball Bearings:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 1/4\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Dual Ball-Bearing: 2BB</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.129\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/S44R4HDB.pdf?v=1691095376\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S44R4HDB Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
